ctypes client with the official Microsoft SDK DLL.

Voice announcements and ATC radio ambience
(navixav/web/static/voice, navixav/web/static/chatter)
  The distribution contains pre-recorded audio files only. No speech
  synthesis engine or voice model is included; the files were produced once
  with scripts/generate_voice_bank.py and scripts/generate_chatter_bank.py.
  The ATC radio ambience uses Kokoro-82M English voices only.
  English, French, Spanish, Italian
    Kokoro-82M                  Apache License 2.0
    https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
    The French voice (ff_siwis) is derived from the SIWIS French speech
    synthesis database, CC BY 4.0.
  German, Dutch, Portuguese, Polish
    Piper voices                de_DE-thorsten-high, nl_NL-pim-medium and
